    "preamble": "Azim Abdul Gaffar Junani vs The State Of Maharashtra on 30 August, 2021 Author: Bharati Dangre Bench: Bharati Dangre Digitally signed by Jayarajan Jayarajan Anjakulath Anjakulath Nair Nair Date: 2021.08.30 17:39:55 +0530 1/2 02 In The High Court Of Judicature At Bombay Criminal Appellate Jurisdiction Anticipatory Bail Application No.2576 Of 2019 Azim Abdul Gaffar Junani .. Vs. The State of Maharashtra .. ... Mr. Tushar N. Sonawane for the Applicant. Ms. A.A. Takalkar, A.P.P. for the State. ... Coram : Smt. Bharati Dangre, J. Dated : 30Th August, 2021. P.C:- 1 . The present Application is segregated from the group of other Applications, which have been clubbed together since all of them invoke offences punishable under Sections 328 of the IPC along with the relevant provisions of the Food Safety and Standard Act, 2006.",
